// Episodes: official documented /api/data/114 endpoint (Atmo Data FAQ, data id 114 =
// J-1/J0/J+1 episodes), filtered server-side by aasqa AND code_zone (department INSEE
// code) IN the real corridor departments, with withGeom=false. aasqa must be included
// in the filter: code_zone alone collides across regions (e.g. department 11 = Aude
// vs AASQA id 11 = Airparif/Ile-de-France both surface under code_zone=11), verified
// live -- adding aasqa eliminates every cross-region false positive.
for (const group of departmentAasqaGroups) {
